This license covers the DSH PRO overlay only — the Electron shell in `shell/`,
the plugins in `plugins/`, and the scripts and documentation in this repository.

DSH PRO is an enhanced desktop client built on DeepSeek Harness. It is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or an official release of DeepSeek or DeepSeek
Harness.

DeepSeek Harness is a separate work, also MIT licensed, and is redistributed
inside the packaged application together with several hundred other third-party
packages. Their licenses are reproduced in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md, which ships
inside the app bundle and is reachable from Settings > About.

One of those dependencies is NOT permissive: libvips, redistributed as a
prebuilt dynamic library via `@img/sharp-libvips-darwin-*`, is licensed
LGPL-3.0-or-later. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for what that requires.
